WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.591
"Tor needs help!" Rex cried.

2
00:00:16.592 --> 00:00:20.939
He jumped out of the stream.

3
00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.880
Sid and Sara followed Rex.

4
00:00:23.881 --> 00:00:28.007
"Help!" Tor cried.

5
00:00:28.008 --> 00:00:34.264
The buddies ran along the stream.

6
00:00:34.265 --> 00:00:38.778
Sara tried to grab Tor.

7
00:00:38.779 --> 00:00:45.873
But Tor zipped past.

8
00:00:45.874 --> 00:00:49.093
"I see a log," Rex said.

9
00:00:49.094 --> 00:00:52.707
The log lay across the stream.

10
00:00:52.708 --> 00:00:57.387
"Let's go!" Sid said.

11
00:00:57.388 --> 00:01:03.617
The buddies ran past Tor.

12
00:01:03.618 --> 00:01:08.504
They ran to the log.

13
00:01:08.505 --> 00:01:14.163
Then they climbed on.

14
00:01:14.164 --> 00:01:17.440
"Here comes Tor!" Sara said.

15
00:01:17.441 --> 00:01:21.055
"I'll get her," Sid said.

16
00:01:21.056 --> 00:01:24.006
Sid let his tail hang down.

17
00:01:24.007 --> 00:01:27.661
"Grab my tail, Tor!"

18
00:01:27.662 --> 00:01:30.935
Water splashed in Tor's eyes.

19
00:01:30.936 --> 00:01:33.621
She couldn't see.

20
00:01:33.622 --> 00:01:36.744
Tor hit Sid's tail. Whap!

21
00:01:36.745 --> 00:01:41.254
"Ouch!" Tor cried.

22
00:01:41.255 --> 00:01:47.518
The stream pulled her away.

23
00:01:47.519 --> 00:01:54.155
Rex shook his head. "This is bad."

24
00:01:54.156 --> 00:01:56.530
"Come on," Sara said.

25
00:01:56.531 --> 00:02:00.920
"We can still—"

26
00:02:00.921 --> 00:02:03.064
Crack!

27
00:02:03.065 --> 00:02:05.287
The log broke.

28
00:02:05.288 --> 00:02:07.617
It fell in the stream.

29
00:02:07.618 --> 00:02:16.040
And so did the buddies!

